 the quality is outstanding — the fish comes straight from the morning catch.","tips":["Head to the second floor for the best raw fish sets.","The hotteok vendor near the east entrance is the best.","Visit in the morning for the freshest selection."],"lat":35.1631,"lng":129.164,"contentType":"venue"},{"slug":"gamcheon-busan","name":"Gamcheon Culture Village","citySlug":"busan","category":"attraction","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1596478573744-0d1af41d9c09?w=1200&q=80","description":"Colourful hillside village with murals and art installations.","address":"Gamcheon-dong, Saha-gu","nearestMetro":"Toseong (Line 1)","priceLevel":"Free","openingHours":"Always","overview":"Painted houses and narrow alleys.","whyVisit":"Iconic Busan photo spot.","tips":[],"lat":35.0977,"lng":129.0104,"contentType":"venue"},{"slug":"haedong-yonggungsa-busan","name":"Haedong Yonggungsa Temple","citySlug":"busan","category":"attraction","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1573057284059-827a26b093f4?w=1200&q=80","description":"Temple by the sea with dramatic coastal views.","address":"Gijang-gun","priceLevel":"Free","openingHours":"Sunrise – Sunset","overview":"One of few seaside temples in Korea.","whyVisit":"Stunning ocean setting.","tips":[],"lat":35.1885,"lng":129.223,"contentType":"venue"},{"slug":"gwangalli-busan","name":"Gwangalli Beach","citySlug":"busan","category":"attraction","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1596478573744-0d1af41d9c09?w=1200&q=80","description":"Beach with bridge views and nightlife.","address":"Gwangalli Beach","priceLevel":"Free","openingHours":"Always","overview":"Sand, cafes and evening lights.","whyVisit":"Great sunset and bridge view.","tips":[],"lat":35.1535,"lng":129.1185,"contentType":"venue"},{"slug":"jagalchi-busan","name":"Jagalchi Market","citySlug":"busan","category":"restaurant","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1567521464027-f127ff144326?w=1200&q=80","description":"Korea's largest seafood market with fresh fish and eateries.","address":"Jagalchi 1-dong","priceLevel":"₩₩","openingHours":"5 AM – 10 PM","overview":"Eat fish bought downstairs, cooked upstairs.","whyVisit":"Essential Busan experience.","tips":[],"lat":35.1025,"lng":129.032,"contentType":"venue"},{"slug":"busan-dwaeji-gukbap","name":"Busan Dwaeji Gukbap","citySlug":"busan","category":"restaurant","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1567521464027-f127ff144326?w=1200&q=80","description":"Pork soup, a Busan specialty.","address":"Seomyeon","priceLevel":"₩","openingHours":"24 hours","overview":"Hearty pork and rice soup.","whyVisit":"Local staple.","tips":[],"lat":35.1578,"lng":129.0602,"contentType":"venue"},{"slug":"busan-millak-cafe","name":"Millak Town Cafe","citySlug":"busan","category":"cafe","image":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1495474472287-4d71bcdd2085?w=1200&q=80","description":"Cafe with Gwangalli view.","address":"Millak-dong","priceLevel":"₩₩","openingHours":"10 AM – 10 PM","overview":"Sea view and coffee.","whyVisit":"Scenic spot.","tips":[],"lat":35.152,"lng":129.115,"contentType":"venue"}]}]]}]
